### Test Server
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### Add Product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rice Bag",
  "category": "Groceries",
  "purchasePrice": 900,
  "sellingPrice": 1000,
  "stock": 50
}

### Get All Customers
GET http://localhost:5000/api/customers

### Add Customer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "address": "Hyderabad"
}

### Create Bill
POST http://localhost:5000/api/billing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ravi Kumar",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PUT_PRODUCT_ID_HERE",
      "productName": "Rice Bag",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 1000
    }
  ],
  "gst": 100,
  "discount": 50
}

### Dashboard Summary
GET http://localhost:5000/api/dashboard

### Stock Report
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/stock

### Low Stock Report
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/low-stock

### Sales Report
GET http://localhost:5000/api/reports/sales

### stock
GET /api/reports/stock
